{"content_hash": "8a37ab8453e094ec", "version_id": 854, "article_id": 86, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Apple brings noise cancelling to cheaper AirPods 5", "title_zh": "苹果把降噪下放到更便宜的 AirPods 5", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "sspai", "source_url": "https://sspai.com/post/118122", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1662946834880-99adabd21f80?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8NHx8dGRzJTIwcmV2aWV3JTIwYXBwbGV8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5MzY3NDkzM3ww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by BoliviaInteligente on Unsplash", "author": "BoliviaInteligente", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@boliviainteligente?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/apple-logo-in-glass-cube-fN4YeoA14OI?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(104, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(142, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "a388a2c1c56a"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-03", "word_count": 236, "reading_minutes": 1.2, "lead": "Apple's new AirPods 5 now offer active noise cancelling on the cheaper model, but a review finds the update is not all good news. The design is unchanged, and the tuning has drawn criticism.", "lead_zh": "苹果新款 AirPods 5 把主动降噪带到了更便宜的版本上，但有评测认为这次升级并非全是好消息。外观没变，调音也受到批评。", "preview": "The biggest change in AirPods 5 is that active noise cancelling is no longer limited to the more expensive version. However, battery life ha", "preview_zh": "AirPods 5 最大的变化是主动降噪不再只属于更贵的版本。不过续航没有明显提升，外观也和 AirPods 4 几乎一样。便宜版本还去掉了充电盒扬声器、无线充电和精确查找，想要这些功能得花 1149 元买另一个版本。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 837, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/86/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 91.425, "size_bytes": 549504, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 265, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@5453546/content/data/versions/854.json", "paragraphs": ["The biggest change in AirPods 5 is that active noise cancelling is no longer limited to the more expensive version. However, battery life has not clearly improved, and the outer design is almost identical to AirPods 4. The cheaper model also loses the case speaker, wireless charging and precision finding, so buyers must pay 1,149 yuan for those features.", "In testing, the noise cancelling proved very strong for an open-fit design. Low-frequency noise was cut sharply, and voices were noticeably reduced, putting it close to AirPods Pro 2. It also adjusted faster than AirPods 4 ANC when the fit shifted, and the transparency mode stayed natural. Call quality was similar to the previous model, though wind noise on calls still needs work.", "Sound quality is the weak point. The default tuning pushes the bass up heavily, which suits hip-hop and dance music but upsets the overall balance. Vocals sit at a moderate distance but lack solidity, and complex tracks can sound slightly muddy. The reviewer says the sound is a step behind the rival Freebuds 7 in bass weight and vocal texture.", "Battery life slightly beat Apple's claim: the wired version lasted 4 hours 44 minutes with noise cancelling on. Connection stability within the Apple ecosystem was excellent, with low latency for video. Overall, the reviewer calls AirPods 5 the strongest open-fit noise-cancelling model available, but says the tuning and call wind noise hold it back."], "paragraphs_zh": ["AirPods 5 最大的变化是主动降噪不再只属于更贵的版本。不过续航没有明显提升，外观也和 AirPods 4 几乎一样。便宜版本还去掉了充电盒扬声器、无线充电和精确查找，想要这些功能得花 1149 元买另一个版本。", "测试中，这款半入耳耳机的降噪表现非常强。低频噪音被大幅削弱，人声也明显降低，接近 AirPods Pro 2 的水平。佩戴松动时它的自适应比 AirPods 4 ANC 更快，通透模式也很自然。通话效果和上一代差不多，但通话抗风噪仍需改进。", "音质是短板。默认调音把低频推得很重，适合嘻哈和舞曲，却破坏了整体平衡。人声距离适中但不够扎实，编曲复杂的曲目会显得有点糊。评测者认为，它在低频量感和人声质感上落后于竞品 Freebuds 7。", "续航略超官方数据：有线版在开启降噪的情况下坚持了 4 小时 44 分钟。在苹果生态内连接很稳定，看视频延迟也低。总体而言，评测者称 AirPods 5 是目前最强的半入耳降噪耳机，但调音和通话抗风噪拖了后腿。"], "body": "The biggest change in AirPods 5 is that active noise cancelling is no longer limited to the more expensive version. However, battery life has not clearly improved, and the outer design is almost identical to AirPods 4. The cheaper model also loses the case speaker, wireless charging and precision finding, so buyers must pay 1,149 yuan for those features.\n\nIn testing, the noise cancelling proved very strong for an open-fit design. Low-frequency noise was cut sharply, and voices were noticeably reduced, putting it close to AirPods Pro 2. It also adjusted faster than AirPods 4 ANC when the fit shifted, and the transparency mode stayed natural. Call quality was similar to the previous model, though wind noise on calls still needs work.\n\nSound quality is the weak point. The default tuning pushes the bass up heavily, which suits hip-hop and dance music but upsets the overall balance. Vocals sit at a moderate distance but lack solidity, and complex tracks can sound slightly muddy. The reviewer says the sound is a step behind the rival Freebuds 7 in bass weight and vocal texture.\n\nBattery life slightly beat Apple's claim: the wired version lasted 4 hours 44 minutes with noise cancelling on. Connection stability within the Apple ecosystem was excellent, with low latency for video. Overall, the reviewer calls AirPods 5 the strongest open-fit noise-cancelling model available, but says the tuning and call wind noise hold it back.", "body_zh": "AirPods 5 最大的变化是主动降噪不再只属于更贵的版本。不过续航没有明显提升，外观也和 AirPods 4 几乎一样。便宜版本还去掉了充电盒扬声器、无线充电和精确查找，想要这些功能得花 1149 元买另一个版本。\n\n测试中，这款半入耳耳机的降噪表现非常强。低频噪音被大幅削弱，人声也明显降低，接近 AirPods Pro 2 的水平。佩戴松动时它的自适应比 AirPods 4 ANC 更快，通透模式也很自然。通话效果和上一代差不多，但通话抗风噪仍需改进。\n\n音质是短板。默认调音把低频推得很重，适合嘻哈和舞曲，却破坏了整体平衡。人声距离适中但不够扎实，编曲复杂的曲目会显得有点糊。评测者认为，它在低频量感和人声质感上落后于竞品 Freebuds 7。\n\n续航略超官方数据：有线版在开启降噪的情况下坚持了 4 小时 44 分钟。在苹果生态内连接很稳定，看视频延迟也低。总体而言，评测者称 AirPods 5 是目前最强的半入耳降噪耳机，但调音和通话抗风噪拖了后腿。", "text": "The biggest change in AirPods 5 is that active noise cancelling is no longer limited to the more expensive version. However, battery life has not clearly improved, and the outer design is almost identical to AirPods 4. The cheaper model also loses the case speaker, wireless charging and precision finding, so buyers must pay 1,149 yuan for those features. In testing, the noise cancelling proved very strong for an open-fit design. Low-frequency noise was cut sharply, and voices were noticeably reduced, putting it close to AirPods Pro 2. It also adjusted faster than AirPods 4 ANC when the fit shifted, and the transparency mode stayed natural. Call quality was similar to the previous model, though wind noise on calls still needs work. Sound quality is the weak point. The default tuning pushes the bass up heavily, which suits hip-hop and dance music but upsets the overall balance. Vocals sit at a moderate distance but lack solidity, and complex tracks can sound slightly muddy. The reviewer says the sound is a step behind the rival Freebuds 7 in bass weight and vocal texture. Battery life slightly beat Apple's claim: the wired version lasted 4 hours 44 minutes with noise cancelling on. Connection stability within the Apple ecosystem was excellent, with low latency for video. Overall, the reviewer calls AirPods 5 the strongest open-fit noise-cancelling model available, but says the tuning and call wind noise hold it back.", "vocab": [{"word": "noise cancelling", "pos": "noun", "zh": "降噪", "note": "常作定语，如 noise-cancelling headphones", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "open-fit", "pos": "adj", "zh": "半入耳的", "note": "指不深入耳道的设计", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "battery life", "pos": "noun", "zh": "续航", "note": "常用搭配 improve battery life", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "tuning", "pos": "noun", "zh": "调音", "note": "指厂商对声音风格的调整", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "transparency mode", "pos": "noun", "zh": "通透模式", "note": "让外界声音进入的功能", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "precision finding", "pos": "noun", "zh": "精确查找", "note": "苹果的定位找耳机功能", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "low-frequency", "pos": "adj", "zh": "低频的", "note": "描述声音或噪音", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "solidity", "pos": "noun", "zh": "扎实度", "note": "形容声音结像稳定", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "muddy", "pos": "adj", "zh": "发糊的", "note": "形容声音不清晰", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "latency", "pos": "noun", "zh": "延迟", "note": "技术常用词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "hold back", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "拖后腿；阻碍", "note": "hold sth back", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "rival", "pos": "adj", "zh": "竞争的；对手的", "note": "也可作名词，指竞争对手", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-03T03:02:11.555592", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.325, "sm": 250, "em": 325, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "biggest", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.65, "sm": 325, "em": 650, "cs": 4, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "change", "s": 0.65, "e": 0.963, "sm": 650, "em": 962, "cs": 12, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "in", "s": 0.963, "e": 1.05, "sm": 962, "em": 1050, "cs": 19, "ce": 21, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "AirPods", "s": 1.05, "e": 1.525, "sm": 1050, "em": 1524, "cs": 22, "ce": 29, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "5", "s": 1.525, "e": 2.162, "sm": 1525, "em": 2162, "cs": 30, "ce": 31, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "is", "s": 2.163, "e": 2.3, "sm": 2162, "em": 2299, "cs": 32, "ce": 34, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "that", "s": 2.3, "e": 2.512, "sm": 2300, "em": 2512, "cs": 35, "ce": 39, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "active", "s": 2.513, "e": 2.9, "sm": 2512, "em": 2899, "cs": 40, "ce": 46, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "noise", "s": 2.9, "e": 3.175, "sm": 2900, "em": 3174, "cs": 47, "ce": 52, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "cancelling", "s": 3.175, "e": 3.837, "sm": 3175, "em": 3837, "cs": 53, "ce": 63, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "is", "s": 3.837, "e": 4.0, "sm": 3837, "em": 4000, "cs": 64, "ce": 66, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "no", "s": 4.0, "e": 4.175, "sm": 4000, "em": 4174, "cs": 67, "ce": 69, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "longer